# Stream events beyond the buffer of the queue are dropped, the oldest first, and counted: with a buffer of 100, a
# burst of 1000 TimeAndSale events ends with the newest ones received, and received plus dropped equals published.
scenario kit-drops
requires capability publisher
config max_buffer_size=100

send endpoint e local_hub
send queue q e TimeAndSale
send subscribe q kit-drops.A kit-drops.END
send publish-burst e TimeAndSale kit-drops.A 1000
send publish e TimeAndSale event_symbol=kit-drops.END price=1
expect poll q 1000 limit=10 -> until kit-drops.END
  accounted kit-drops.A 1000
  dropped >= 1
  last kit-drops.A price=1000
  increasing kit-drops.A price
  monotonic dropped
end
